### Quiz API Tests
### Base URL for automations service

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8010
@serviceId = 29cd9df9-7607-4728-a1b0-db7678f9e3da

### ============================================================================
### Start Quiz
### ============================================================================

### Start a new quiz session
# This will check if qdrant_collection exists for the service
# If no collection: starts with initial business question
# If collection exists: TODO (returns message about RAG)

POST {{baseUrl}}/internal-quiz/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "service_id": "{{serviceId}}"
}

### ============================================================================
### Submit Answer
### ============================================================================

### Submit answer to initial business question
# After starting, answer the first question about your business field
# This will generate the bullet list of information to collect

@sessionId = 0efb2f20-cd17-4d1d-8886-4b54a6ace84f

POST {{baseUrl}}/internal-quiz/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
    "answer": "Siamo una RSA per anziani"
}

### Submit subsequent answers
# Continue answering questions until all bullet items are completed
# Each response includes the updated bullet_list with completion status

POST {{baseUrl}}/internal-quiz/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "session_id": "{{sessionId}}",
    "answer": "i servizi includono assistenza medica, attività ricreative e pasti personalizzati. Il prezzo varia in base al tipo di camera e ai servizi richiesti. Quindi è necessario fissare un appuntamento per una consulenza personalizzata."
}

### ============================================================================
### Get State
### ============================================================================

### Get current session state
# Returns full state including messages history and bullet list

GET {{baseUrl}}/internal-quiz/{{sessionId}}/state

### ============================================================================
### Finish Quiz
### ============================================================================

### Force finish quiz early
# Generates markdown with information collected so far

POST {{baseUrl}}/internal-quiz/finish
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "session_id": "{{sessionId}}"
}

### ============================================================================
### List Sessions
### ============================================================================

### List all active sessions

GET {{baseUrl}}/internal-quiz/sessions


### ============================================================================
### Example Flow
### ============================================================================

### 1. Start quiz
# POST /internal-quiz/start with service_id
# Response: {session_id, question, bullet_list: [], phase: "initial_question", ...}

### 2. Answer initial question about business
# POST /internal-quiz/answer with session_id and answer about your business
# Response: {question, bullet_list: [{name: "servizi", completed: false}, ...], phase: "collecting", ...}

### 3. Continue answering
# POST /internal-quiz/answer with subsequent answers
# bullet_list items become completed: true as information is collected
# Response includes updated bullet_list each time

### 4. Quiz completes when:
# - All bullet_list items have completed: true
# - OR max_turns (20) is reached
# Response: {done: true, extracted_markdown: "...", bullet_list: [...]}

### 5. (Optional) Force finish early
# POST /internal-quiz/finish to end quiz and generate markdown with partial info
